The files in this directory are Lua 5.4.7 (https://www.lua.org/), vendored into
libmoy as a convenience rather than a dependency -- moy_lua_open binds to
whichever lua_State a host hands it, so a host with its own Lua does not need
this copy.

They have been MODIFIED, in two ways and no others:

  1. The sources for io, os, debug, package, coroutine and linit are DELETED,
     not merely left unregistered. The moy spec's sandbox (SPEC.md 4.1) calls
     itself "a maximum, not a suggestion", and removing the sources is what
     makes "absent entirely" true of the machine code rather than only of the
     global table.
  2. The build is configured LUA_32BITS, which SPEC.md 4.2 requires (32-bit
     integers and floats) and SPEC.md 11 assumes of the build that generates
     golden frames.

